122
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,400
Umura-Chan.

123
00:09:49,860 --> 00:09:51,440
Aber auch das hätte an Tomoe,

124
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,300
Mamis Schicksal,

125
00:09:52,380 --> 00:09:53,080
