174
00:11:58,180 --> 00:11:59,360
Ich erinnere mich.

175
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:02,080
Ich werde Mami-san

176
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,600
nicht vergessen.

177
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,380
Ganz sicher nicht.

178
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:07,120
Tja,

179
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,840
Tomoe Mami kann sich

180
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,760
